          "content": {
            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "size": 2018,
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html class=\"login-pf\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" />\n\n            <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"/>\n    <title>Sign in to Digitální technická mapa Jihočeského kraje</title>\n    <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/auth/resources/pgt7l/login/keycloak/img/favicon.ico\" />\n            <link href=\"/auth/resources/pgt7l/common/keycloak/vendor/patternfly-v4/patternfly.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\n            <link href=\"/auth/resources/pgt7l/common/keycloak/vendor/patternfly-v3/css/patternfly.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\n            <link href=\"/auth/resources/pgt7l/common/keycloak/vendor/patternfly-v3/css/patternfly-additions.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\n            <link href=\"/auth/resources/pgt7l/common/keycloak/lib/pficon/pficon.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\n            <link href=\"/auth/resources/pgt7l/login/keycloak/css/login.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\n    <script nonce=\"865cba4b25208adf96df8c3ceb0cb05c\" type=\"importmap\">\n        {\n            \"imports\": {\n                \"rfc4648\": \"/auth/resources/pgt7l/common/keycloak/vendor/rfc4648/rfc4648.js\"\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n    <script nonce=\"865cba4b25208adf96df8c3ceb0cb05c\" src=\"/auth/resources/pgt7l/login/keycloak/js/menu-button-links.js\" type=\"module\"></script>\n    <script nonce=\"865cba4b25208adf96df8c3ceb0cb05c\" type=\"module\">\n        import { startSessionPolling } from \"/auth/resources/pgt7l/login/keycloak/js/authChecker.js\";\n\n        startSessionPolling(\n            \"/auth/realms/JCK/login-actions/restart?client_id=crystal&tab_id=bA5JR4Wfw2s&client_data=eyJydSI6Imh0dHBzOi8vamNrLmtyYWpkdG0uY3ovLS9wdWJsaWMiLCJydCI6ImNvZGUifQ&skip_logout=true\"\n        );\n    </script>\n    <script nonce=\"865cba4b25208adf96df8c3ceb0cb05c\" type=\"module\">\n        document.addEventListener(\"click\", (event) => {\n            const link = event.target.closest(\"a[data-once-link]\");\n\n            if (!link) {\n                return;\n            }\n\n            if (link.getAttribute(\"aria-disabled\") === \"true\") {\n                event.preventDefault();\n                return;\n            }\n\n            const { disabledClass } = link.dataset;\n\n            if (disabledClass) {\n                link.classList.add(...disabledClass.trim().split(/\\s+/));\n            }\n\n            link.setAttribute(\"role\", \"link\");\n            link.setAttribute(\"aria-disabled\", \"true\");\n        });\n    </script>\n        <script nonce=\"865cba4b25208adf96df8c3ceb0cb05c\" type=\"module\">\n            import { checkAuthSession } from \"/auth/resources/pgt7l/login/keycloak/js/authChecker.js\";\n\n            checkAuthSession(\n                \"6AxjTOUG0xJjQSSYqLZa07BzXuWeW+xawwEDhOW8pfI\"\n            );\n        </script>\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"\" data-page-id=\"login-login\">\n<div class=\"login-pf-page\">\n    <div id=\"kc-header\" class=\"login-pf-page-header\">\n        <div id=\"kc-header-wrapper\"\n             class=\"\">Digitální technická mapa Jihočeského kraje</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card-pf\">\n        <header class=\"login-pf-header\">\n                <div class=\"pf-c-dropdown\" id=\"kc-locale\">\n                    <div id=\"kc-locale-wrapper\" class=\"\">\n                        <div id=\"kc-locale-dropdown\" class=\"menu-button-links \">\n                            <button tabindex=\"1\" id=\"kc-current-locale-link\" aria-label=\"languages\" aria-haspopup=\"true\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"language-switch1\">English</button>\n                            <ul role=\"menu\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-labelledby=\"kc-current-locale-link\" aria-activedescendant=\"\" id=\"language-switch1\" class=\"pf-c-dropdown__menu pf-m-align-right\">\n                                    <li class=\"\" role=\"none\">\n                                        <a role=\"menuitem\" id=\"language-1\" class=\"pf-c-dropdown__menu-item\" href=\"/auth/realms/JCK/login-actions/authenticate?client_id=crystal&amp;tab_id=bA5JR4Wfw2s&amp;client_data=eyJydSI6Imh0dHBzOi8vamNrLmtyYWpkdG0uY3ovLS9wdWJsaWMiLCJydCI6ImNvZGUifQ&amp;execution=5ecdede6-b1ca-442e-861b-a45338ffde7e&amp;kc_locale=cs\">Czech (Čeština)</a>\n                                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"\" role=\"none\">\n                                        <a role=\"menuitem\" id=\"language-2\" class=\"pf-c-dropdown__menu-item\" href=\"/auth/realms/JCK/login-actions/authenticate?client_id=crystal&amp;tab_id=bA5JR4Wfw2s&amp;client_data=eyJydSI6Imh0dHBzOi8vamNrLmtyYWpkdG0uY3ovLS9wdWJsaWMiLCJydCI6ImNvZGUifQ&amp;execution=5ecdede6-b1ca-442e-861b-a45338ffde7e&amp;kc_locale=en\">English</a>\n                                    </li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <h1 id=\"kc-page-title\">        Sign in to your account\n\n</h1>\n      </header>\n      <div id=\"kc-content\">\n        <div id=\"kc-content-wrapper\">\n\n\n        <div id=\"kc-form\">\n        </div>\n        <script nonce=\"865cba4b25208adf96df8c3ceb0cb05c\" type=\"module\" src=\"/auth/resources/pgt7l/login/keycloak/js/passwordVisibility.js\"></script>\n\n\n\n            <div id=\"kc-social-providers\" class=\"kc-social-section kc-social-gray\">\n                <hr/>\n                <!--\n                <h2>Or sign in with</h2>\n                -->\n                <ul class=\"pf-c-login__main-footer-links kc-social-links\">\n                        <li>\n                            <a data-once-link data-disabled-class=\"pf-m-aria-disabled\" id=\"social-saml2\"\n                                    class=\"pf-c-button pf-m-control pf-m-block kc-social-item kc-social-gray \"\n                                    type=\"button\" href=\"/auth/realms/JCK/broker/saml2/login?client_id=crystal&amp;tab_id=bA5JR4Wfw2s&amp;client_data=eyJydSI6Imh0dHBzOi8vamNrLmtyYWpkdG0uY3ovLS9wdWJsaWMiLCJydCI6ImNvZGUifQ&amp;session_code=0idmDdn2dQ-dqQxNeeBl9U7QSM3KWa8gP5IVBEpErYQ\">\n                                    <img src=\"/auth/resources/pgt7l/login/keycloak/img/erb-blue.svg\" alt=\"Ikona NIA\" class=\"kc-social-icon\" style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px;\">\n                                    <span class=\"kc-social-provider-name\">Identita občana (NIA)</span>\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
